Not included, and not ours to include
-------------------------------------

The Bluetooth chip's firmware patch (BCM4343A1.hcd, Cypress / Infineon) is
not part of Lossless OS. The player loads it from its own card, where it
comes from the player's original firmware (docs/h2-hardware.md, "Bluetooth").
